> bsany(x: u8) = ((x&1) | ((x>>1)&1) | ((x>>2)&1) | ((x>>3)&1) | ((x>>4)&1) | ((x>>5)&1) | ((x>>6)&1) | ((x>>7)&1))
> pcan(x: u8) = popcount(x) != 0 ? 1 : 0
> equiv bsany pcan
bsany and pcan are equal on the domain of bsany (exhaustive)
> bs4(x: u32) = (((x xor 0x0f0f0f0f) & 0x11111111) == 0) ? 1 : 0
> bs4b(x: u32) = (popcount((x xor 0x0f0f0f0f) & 0x11111111) == 0) ? 1 : 0
> equiv bs4 bs4b
bs4 and bs4b are equal on the domain of bs4 (proved by SAT: 162 AIG nodes, 44 conflicts)
> bsz(x: u32) = ((x | (x>>1) | (x>>2) | (x>>3)) & 1) == 0 ? 1 : 0
> bsz2(x: u32) = (x & 0x0f) == 0 ? 1 : 0
> equiv bsz bsz2
bsz and bsz2 are equal on the domain of bsz (proved by SAT: 123 AIG nodes, 0 conflicts)
